guide butler-routes-completionist/ashenvale-horde
title Ashenvale (Horde)
levels 19-30
zone Ashenvale
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step East - Splintertree Post, mustering

  note Splintertree Post is the Horde hub: Senani Thunderheart, Pixel, Kuray'bin, Gurda Ragescar, Locke Okarr, Mastok Wrilehiss, Yama Snowhoof, Ertog Ragetusk, and the writ-taker Ash'alari. Take the hub's asks here; the forest fills them.
  accept 6383 -- The Ashenvale Hunt - Senani Thunderheart; the hunt opens with Sharptalon, Ursangous and Shadumbra, east and west
  turnin 6383 -- The Ashenvale Hunt - back to Senani Thunderheart
  note 6383 carries no objectives of its own - it opens the three beast item-starts below, which need it in the log.
  accept 6441 -- Satyr Horns - Pixel; sixteen Satyr Horns out of the Xavian satyrs, far east
  note 6441's horns fill on the eastern sweep below - hand them in on the return.
  accept 6503 -- Ashenvale Outrunners - Kuray'bin; nine Ashenvale Outrunners in the woods north of the post
  note 6503's runners fill on the eastern sweep below - hand them in on the return.
  accept 6504 -- The Lost Pages - Gurda Ragescar; the twelve missing Shredder Manual pages, bound as Chapters 1, 2 and 3
  note 6504's pages name no dropper and no vendor anywhere in the data - have Chapters 1, 2 and 3 (items 16642-16644) in your bags.
  accept 6571 -- Warsong Supplies - Locke Okarr; Saw Blades, Logging Rope, Warsong Oil and the Warsong Axe Shipment
  note 6571's four supplies scatter wide: rope off the Thistlefur furbolgs west, oil out of the Warsong camp crates, blades off Pixel himself, and the axe shipment all the way in Stranglethorn - the legs below gather each in turn.
  accept 94213 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Lesser Mana Potion - the writ (item 264013) and a Lesser Mana Potion (crafted, or bought widely)
  note 94213's writ has no placed source in the data - have the writ and a Lesser Mana Potion in your bags.
  turnin 94213 optional -- Craftsman's Writ: Lesser Mana Potion - back to Ash'alari
  accept 25 -- Stonetalon Standstill - Mastok Wrilehiss; twelve Befouled Water Elementals at Mystral Lake, and the gazebo above the Alliance outpost

step Center - Mystral Lake and Tideress

  complete 25 @45.08,69.3 era -- twelve Befouled Water Elementals for Mastok Wrilehiss, around Mystral Lake
  note The elementals cluster around (45-50, 67-72) - work the lakeshore for all twelve.
  complete 25 @48.92,69.56 era -- scout the gazebo on Mystral Lake for Mastok Wrilehiss, above the Alliance outpost
  collect 16408 @46.0,70.0 era -- the Befouled Water Globe off Tideress for Mastok Wrilehiss
  note The Befouled Water Globe starts The Befouled Element in your bags - Mastok takes it on the return below.
  accept 1918 -- The Befouled Element - the Befouled Water Globe to Mastok Wrilehiss at Splintertree Post

step East - Sharptalon's ground

  collect 16305 @74.98,70.06 era -- Sharptalon's Claw off Sharptalon for Senani Thunderheart
  note Sharptalon's Claw starts Sharptalon's Claw in your bags - Senani takes it on the return below.
  accept 2 -- Sharptalon's Claw - the claw to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post

step East - the Outrunner woods and the satyrs

  complete 6503 @70.97,72.6 era -- nine Ashenvale Outrunners for Kuray'bin, in the woods north of Splintertree
  note The outrunners range around (70-76, 69-76) - work the woods for all nine.
  collect 5481 x16 @77.58,46.17 era -- sixteen Satyr Horns off the Xavian satyrs for Pixel
  note The Xavian rogues cluster around (77-78, 43-46), east past the post - work the camp for all sixteen horns.

step East - Splintertree Post, first return

  turnin 2 -- Sharptalon's Claw - the claw to Senani Thunderheart
  turnin 25 -- Stonetalon Standstill - back to Mastok Wrilehiss
  turnin 1918 -- The Befouled Element - the globe to Mastok Wrilehiss
  accept 824 -- Je'neu of the Earthen Ring - Mastok Wrilehiss; the Befouled Water Globe goes to Je'neu Sancrea at Zoram'gar, far west
  note 824 waited on 1918's turn-in - carry the fresh globe west with the outpost business.
  turnin 6503 -- Ashenvale Outrunners - back to Kuray'bin

step South - Torek's assault and Kadrak's bundle

  accept 6544 -- Torek's Assault - Torek; escort him against Silverwing Outpost, then Ertog Ragetusk hears of it at Splintertree
  complete 6544 @64.65,75.35 era -- take Silverwing Outpost with Torek for Ertog Ragetusk
  note Silverwing Outpost sits at the recorded assault point - fight through it with Torek, then carry the word back east.

step South - Kadrak's tower

  note Kadrak holds the southern tower for the Horde war effort. Travellers carrying a twin report from the Barrens or Stonetalon hand it in here; everyone else takes the bundle on its own.
  accept 6543 -- The Warsong Reports - Kadrak; the Bundle of Reports goes to the Scout, the Runner and the Outrider, and their updates come back to Kadrak's Barrens tower
  note 6543 needs neither twin to take it - holders of 6541 or 6542 use the mini-steps below; everyone else takes it here on its own. Have the Bundle of Reports (item 16783, no placed source in the data) in your bags.

step South - the Barrens twin report

  when onquest 6541
  turnin 6541 -- Report to Kadrak - Thork's word to Kadrak
  accept 6543 -- The Warsong Reports - Kadrak; the Bundle of Reports goes to the Scout, the Runner and the Outrider
  note Have the Bundle of Reports (item 16783, no placed source in the data) in your bags.

step South - the Stonetalon twin report

  when onquest 6542
  turnin 6542 -- Report to Kadrak - Darn Talongrip's word to Kadrak
  accept 6543 -- The Warsong Reports - Kadrak; the Bundle of Reports goes to the Scout, the Runner and the Outrider
  note Have the Bundle of Reports (item 16783, no placed source in the data) in your bags.

step East - the Scout's update, then the Outrider's

  accept 6547 -- Warsong Scout Update - the Warsong Scout; his report for Kadrak's bundle
  note The Report (item 16746) names no mob, object or vendor anywhere in the data - have the Warsong Report in your bags.
  turnin 6547 -- Warsong Scout Update - back to the Warsong Scout
  collect 16764 @71.05,68.36 era -- the Warsong Scout Update from the Warsong Scout for Kadrak's bundle
  collect 16744 @78.18,44.75 era -- Warsong Oil out of the Warsong camp crates for Locke Okarr's supplies
  note 6571's oil fills here among the eastern camp crates - the axe shipment waits for the Stranglethorn expedition.
  accept 6546 -- Warsong Outrider Update - the Warsong Outrider; his report for Kadrak's bundle
  note The Report (item 16746) names no mob, object or vendor anywhere in the data - have the Warsong Report in your bags.
  turnin 6546 -- Warsong Outrider Update - back to the Warsong Outrider
  collect 16765 @81.83,53.51 era -- the Warsong Outrider Update from the Warsong Outrider for Kadrak's bundle

step West - Zoram'gar outpost, first visit

  note The far west hub: Karang Amakkar, the Zoram Strand vendors Marukai and Mitsuwa, Warsong Runner, Muglash, and Je'neu Sancrea's cave. Take the outpost's asks here; the strand and the hills fill them.
  accept 216 -- Between a Rock and a Thistlefur - Karang Amakkar; eight Thistlefur Avengers and eight Shamans, east in Thistlefur Village
  note 216's kills fill on the central sweep below - hand them in on the way back through.
  accept 6442 -- Naga at the Zoram Strand - Marukai; twenty Wrathtail Heads along the strand
  complete 6442 @6.02,11.0 era -- twenty Wrathtail Heads off the Wrathtail along the strand for Marukai
  note The Wrathtail line the strand around (5-8, 11-16) - work the shoreline for all twenty heads.
  turnin 6442 -- Naga at the Zoram Strand - back to Marukai
  accept 6462 -- Troll Charm - Mitsuwa; eight Troll Charms out of the Troll Chests, east past the strand
  note 6462's charms fill on the central sweep below - hand them in on the way back through.
  accept 6545 -- Warsong Runner Update - the Warsong Runner; his report for Kadrak's bundle
  note The Report (item 16746) names no mob, object or vendor anywhere in the data - have the Warsong Report in your bags. This completes Kadrak's set of three updates.
  turnin 6545 -- Warsong Runner Update - back to the Warsong Runner
  collect 16763 @12.22,34.22 era -- the Warsong Runner Update from the Warsong Runner for Kadrak's bundle
  accept 6641 -- Vorsha the Lasher - Muglash; see him to the brazier south of the outpost and put it out
  complete 6641 @9.59,27.58 era -- see Muglash to the brazier and defeat Vorsha the Lasher for the Warsong Runner
  turnin 6641 -- Vorsha the Lasher - Muglash's word to the Warsong Runner
  accept 6921 -- Amongst the Ruins - Je'neu Sancrea; the Fathom Core
  note 6921's Fathom Stone object has no placed spawn in the data - have the Fathom Core (item 16762) in your bags.
  turnin 6921 -- Amongst the Ruins - the Fathom Core to Je'neu Sancrea
  accept 6922 -- Baron Aquanis - Je'neu Sancrea; the Strange Water Globe
  note 6922's globe drops off Baron Aquanis, who has no placed spawn in the data - have the Strange Water Globe (item 16782) in your bags.
  turnin 6922 -- Baron Aquanis - the Strange Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea
  accept 909 -- Baron Aquanis - Je'neu Sancrea; the same Strange Water Globe, the twin of 6922 above
  note 909 records no starter of its own in the data - it shares 6922's globe and Je'neu's turn-in, so take it here on the twin's evidence.
  turnin 909 -- Baron Aquanis - the Strange Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea
  note 6564 (Allegiance to the Old Gods) starts from the Damp Note and turns in to Je'neu - the note fills on the northern leg below, and the accept rides there with it.

step Center-west - Thistlefur and the troll chests

  complete 216 @31.38,45.24 era -- eight Thistlefur Avengers for Karang Amakkar, in Thistlefur Village
  note The Avengers range around (31-38, 32-45) - work the village for all eight.
  complete 216 @30.28,42.26 era -- eight Thistlefur Shaman for Karang Amakkar, in Thistlefur Village
  note The Shaman range around (30-36, 31-45) - work the village for all eight.
  collect 16743 @31.55,45.66 era -- Logging Rope off the Thistlefur furbolgs for Locke Okarr's supplies
  note The furbolgs drop the rope all through the village - take one for 6571's set.
  collect 16602 x8 @40.39,33.24 era -- eight Troll Charms out of the Troll Chests for Mitsuwa, east of the Zoram Strand
  note The Troll Chests stand clustered around (40-41, 31-35) - work the cluster for all eight charms.
  accept 6482 -- Freedom to Ruul - Ruul Snowhoof; see him free of the Thistlefurs, then Yama Snowhoof hears of it far east
  complete 6482 @38.53,37.32 era -- escort Ruul Snowhoof free of the Thistlefur camp for Yama Snowhoof
  note Yama waits at Splintertree far east - hand 6482 in on the eastern return below.

step Center - Ursangous's ground and the void caller

  collect 16303 @39.76,65.21 era -- Ursangous's Paw off Ursangous for Senani Thunderheart
  note Ursangous's Paw starts Ursangous's Paw in your bags - Senani takes it on the eastern return below.
  accept 23 -- Ursangous's Paw - the paw to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post
  accept 98251 -- Never Coming Back - Va'xug Firefure; six Shadowhorn Stag and six Ashenvale Bear, north-west of Fallen Sky Lake
  complete 98251 @37.58,61.82 era -- six Shadowhorn Stag for Va'xug Firefure, in the woods north-west of Fallen Sky Lake
  note The stags range around (37-50, 48-72) - work the woods for all six.
  complete 98251 @37.79,39.36 era -- six Ashenvale Bear for Va'xug Firefure, down toward the Thistlefur country
  note The bears range around (32-50, 35-71) - work the woods for all six.
  turnin 98251 -- Never Coming Back - back to Va'xug Firefure
  accept 98252 -- A Void Path - Va'xug Firefure; show the Eye of Kilrogg the way back to the main road
  complete 98252 @38.27,58.41 era -- guide the Eye of Kilrogg to the road for Va'xug Firefure
  turnin 98252 -- A Void Path - the Eye's word to the Eye of Kilrogg

step West - Zoram'gar outpost, second visit

  turnin 216 -- Between a Rock and a Thistlefur - back to Karang Amakkar
  accept 6621 -- King of the Foulweald - Karang Amakkar; the banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound, then Chief Murgut
  turnin 6462 -- Troll Charm - back to Mitsuwa

step Center-east - the mound and Shadumbra

  complete 6621 @56.5,63.5 era -- place Karang's banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound and take Chief Murgut's Totem for Karang Amakkar
  note Chief Murgut walks the mound itself at (56.43, 63.5) - the banner first, then the chief. Karang takes the totem on the western return below.
  collect 16304 @57.5,56.05 era -- Shadumbra's Head off Shadumbra for Senani Thunderheart
  note Shadumbra's Head starts Shadumbra's Head in your bags - Senani takes it on the eastern return below.
  accept 24 -- Shadumbra's Head - the head to Senani Thunderheart at Splintertree Post

step East - Splintertree Post, second return

  turnin 23 -- Ursangous's Paw - the paw to Senani Thunderheart
  turnin 24 -- Shadumbra's Head - the head to Senani Thunderheart
  accept 247 -- The Hunt Completed - Senani Thunderheart; the three-beast hunt closes here
  note 247 waited on all three hunt turn-ins - the hunt is done, take the closing word.
  turnin 247 -- The Hunt Completed - back to Senani Thunderheart
  turnin 6441 -- Satyr Horns - the sixteen horns to Pixel
  collect 16742 @73.06,61.48 era -- Warsong Saw Blades off Pixel himself for Locke Okarr's supplies
  note The drop data names Pixel as the blades' only source - take them off him with the turn-in.
  turnin 6544 -- Torek's Assault - the Silverwing word to Ertog Ragetusk
  turnin 6482 -- Freedom to Ruul - Ruul's freedom to Yama Snowhoof

step North - the Blackfathom camp

  collect 16790 @13.55,12.06 era optional -- the Damp Note off a Blackfathom Tide Priestess for Je'neu Sancrea
  note Blackfathom Tide Priestess is elite: grouping up is advised.
  accept 6564 -- Allegiance to the Old Gods - take it on the Damp Note; Je'neu Sancrea takes it in the west below
  note 6564's chain link (6562, Trouble in the Deeps) sits in Stonetalon, uncontracted - take 6564 on its own here.

step West - Zoram'gar outpost, third visit

  turnin 6564 -- Allegiance to the Old Gods - the Damp Note to Je'neu Sancrea
  accept 6565 -- Allegiance to the Old Gods - Je'neu Sancrea; Lorgus Jett waits inside Blackfathom Deeps
  turnin 824 -- Je'neu of the Earthen Ring - the Befouled Water Globe to Je'neu Sancrea
  turnin 6621 -- King of the Foulweald - Murgut's Totem to Karang Amakkar

step Je'neu's cave - the Stonetalon word

  when onquest 6562
  turnin 6562 -- Trouble in the Deeps - Tsunaman's word to Je'neu Sancrea
  accept 6563 -- The Essence of Aku'Mai - Je'neu Sancrea; twenty Sapphires of Aku'Mai, north
  note 6563's sapphires fill on the northern leg below - take 6563 here if 6562 brought you in.

step North - sapphires for the Stonetalon word

  when onquest 6563
  complete 6563 @13.17,13.49 era -- twenty Sapphires of Aku'Mai off the surf-cave mouths for Je'neu Sancrea
  note The sapphire mouths cluster around (13-14, 10-13) - work the cluster for all twenty. This leg only runs holding 6563.

step West - the sapphires delivered

  when onquest 6563
  turnin 6563 -- The Essence of Aku'Mai - the sapphires to Je'neu Sancrea

step North - the Deeps doors

  complete 6565 @13.55,12.06 era -- Lorgus Jett waits inside Blackfathom Deeps for Je'neu Sancrea; descend from the Blackfathom camp
  note No entrance marker exists in the data - the kill sits inside the Deeps past this camp, so go in fighting and come back out to turn in.

step Je'neu's cave - the Deeps word delivered

  turnin 6565 -- Allegiance to the Old Gods - Lorgus Jett's death to Je'neu Sancrea

step East - Splintertree Post, closing the pages

  turnin 6504 -- The Lost Pages - the bound chapters to Gurda Ragescar

step Barrens - Kadrak's tower and the Runed Scroll

  zone The Barrens
  note The bundle's updates are gathered - cross into the Barrens for Kadrak's northern guard tower.
  turnin 6543 -- The Warsong Reports - the three updates to Kadrak at the northern guard tower
  collect 10621 @46.0,70.0 era optional -- the Runed Scroll off Aean Swiftriver for Kadrak's tower
  note Aean Swiftriver is elite: grouping up is advised.
  note The Runed Scroll starts The Runed Scroll in your bags - the tower takes it below.
  accept 3513 -- The Runed Scroll - the scroll to Kadrak at the northern guard tower
  turnin 3513 -- The Runed Scroll - back to Kadrak
  accept 3514 -- Horde Presence - Kadrak; Rynthariel the Keymaster holds the Talon Den in Stonetalon, south-west
  note 3514 waited on 3513's turn-in - carry Kadrak's flag into Stonetalon below.

step Stonetalon - the Talon Den

  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  note Rynthariel's Talon Den sits across the border in Stonetalon - a short expedition from the tower.
  complete 3514 @29.71,16.91 era -- kill Rynthariel the Keymaster for Kadrak
  zone Ashenvale

step Barrens - the den-master answered

  zone The Barrens
  turnin 3514 -- Horde Presence - Rynthariel's death to Kadrak at the northern guard tower
  zone Ashenvale

step Stranglethorn - the axe shipment

  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  note 6571's last supply sits far south in Stranglethorn - one expedition for the set.
  collect 16745 @26.43,73.3 era -- the Warsong Axe Shipment for Locke Okarr's supplies
  zone Ashenvale

step East - the supplies delivered

  turnin 6571 -- Warsong Supplies - the four supplies to Locke Okarr
  accept 6581 -- Warsong Saw Blades - Pixel; a Deadly Blunderbuss for the post's arsenal
  note 6581 waited on 6571's turn-in - and its Blunderbuss (item 4369) names no dropper or vendor anywhere in the data, so have it in your bags.
  turnin 6581 -- Warsong Saw Blades - the Blunderbuss to Pixel
